<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Jawbreaker</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <meta name="description" content="Jawbreaker Game, also called Same Game"/>
    <meta
            name="keywords"
            content="jawbreaker, same game, online games, free games"
    />
    <meta name="rating" content="Safe For Kids"/>
    <link rel="icon" href="static/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon"/>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{.Style}}"/>
    <style>
        #game {
            grid-template-columns: repeat({{.Cols}}, {{.BlockSize}}px);
            grid-template-rows: repeat({{.Rows}}, {{.BlockSize}}px);
            gap: {{.GapSize}}px;
        }
    </style>
    <script type="module" src="{{.Datastar}}"></script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container"
     data-signals="{gameOver:false,currentScore:0,lastScore:{{.LastScore}},bestScore:{{.BestScore}},pieces:'{{.Pieces}}'}"
>
    <div class="sidebar">
        <div class="title">Jawbreaker</div>
        <div class="score-container">
            <div class="score-box">
                <div class="score-label">Current</div>
                <div id="current-score" class="score-value" data-text="$currentScore">0</div>
            </div>
            <div class="score-box">
                <div class="score-label">Last</div>
                <div id="last-score" class="score-value" data-text="$lastScore">0</div>
            </div>
            <div class="score-box">
                <div class="score-label">Best</div>
                <div id="best-score" class="score-value" data-text="$bestScore">0</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button id="help-btn" class="help-btn">Help</button>
    </div>

    <main id="game-container"
          data-on-click="@post('click/'+evt.target.id)"
          data-on-mouseover="@post('mouse/'+evt.target.id)"
          data-on-mouseleave="@post('mouse/exit')">
        {{.Game}}
        <section class="game-over-overlay" id="game-over-overlay" data-class="{'visible': $gameOver}">
            <article class="game-over-content">
                <h2>Game Over!</h2>
                <p>You scored <span data-text="$currentScore">0</span> points.</p>
                <button class="new-game-btn" data-on-click="@post('new');">
                    New Game
                </button>
            </article>
        </section>
    </main>
</div>
<div id="help-modal" class="modal">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <span class="close">&times;</span>
        <h2>How to Play Jawbreaker</h2>
        <p>Jawbreaker is a puzzle game where you remove groups of connected balls of the same color.</p>
        <p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>Click on a group of two or more connected balls of the same color to remove them.</li>
            <li>After removing balls, the remaining balls will fall down to fill empty spaces.</li>
            <li>If a column becomes empty, columns to the right will shift left to fill the gap.</li>
            <li>The more balls you remove at once, the higher your score.</li>
            <li>The game ends when there are no more valid moves.</li>
            <li>If you clear most of the board, you'll get bonus points!</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Scoring:</strong></p>
        <p>Score = n × (n-1) where n is the number of balls removed.</p>
        <p>Bonus points are awarded if you finish with fewer than 20 balls remaining.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
